2026-07-27T09:39:10.0522074Z i /tmp/Rtmpu56Ahg/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:39:10.0522501Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:39:10.0523001Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:39:10.0523728Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:39:10.0524418Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:39:10.0525761Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:39:10.0526743Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
